   {
    "en": "Host \u0026 Corporate Slave"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Naoto, a “corporate slave,” and Ren, a “host,” meet at 5:00 a.m., at a beef bowl restaurant in Shinjuku's Kabuki-Chō.\nThey are complete strangers who just so happen to share breakfast each day side by side, a rather unusual relationship.\n\nA corporate slave whose day is about to begin and a host whose day has finally come to an end.\nThis is a morning routine story that depicts the only 15 minutes in which these two people, who live on opposite sides of the clock, intersect!",
   "ja": "午前５時、新宿歌舞伎町の牛丼屋で出会った「社畜」の直人と「ホスト」の蓮。並んで朝ごはんを食べるだけの、ちょっと不思議な関係がはじまる――。これから一日が始まる社畜と、ようやく一日が終わるホスト。真逆な時間軸を生きる二人が唯一交わる15分を描いた、モーニングルーティンストーリー。"
  },
